{"id":883884,"title":"直播回放｜MCP &A2A 协议如何解决智能体开发痛点?","content":"<p><video poster=\"https://media001.geekbang.org/504f0a1c47f671f0a42d4531959c0102/snapshots/9c4c7152855040189b3ed22a5411ab01-00005.jpg\" preload=\"none\" controls=\"\"><source src=\"https://media001.geekbang.org/customerTrans/7e27d07d27d407ebcc195a0e78395f55/3d11211a-19766e9b07c-0000-0000-01d-dbacd.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"><source src=\" https://media001.geekbang.org/20a5ffc147fd71f0800a4531858c0402/c0cecedee3e54a6b821473859218a0d7-b1ceed4b49163dbab27658dddd3ad3cb-sd.m3u8\" type=\"application/x-mpegURL\"></video></p><h2>你将获得</h2><ul>\n<li>为什么 MCP&amp;A2A 协议诞生在此时此刻？</li>\n<li>MCP 和 A2A 协议异同详解</li>\n<li>MCP 和 A2A 解决了开发过程中的哪些痛点</li>\n<li>手把手带你基于 A2A 快速开发智能体</li>\n</ul><h2>要点提炼</h2><p><strong>大模型时代的技术背景与趋势</strong></p><ul>\n<li>当前正处于计算2.0时代，其核心是从精确计算转向概率性推理。</li>\n<li>AI正快速发展，智能体已能完成真实认知工作，预计未来将具备发现新知识的能力。</li>\n<li>从农业时代的经验型智能，到工业时代的技能型智能，再到科技时代的知识型智能，如今进入协作型智能阶段。</li>\n</ul><p><strong>MCP协议的作用与价值</strong></p><ul>\n<li>MCP协议旨在连接大模型与外部工具，解决模型与现实世界的割裂问题。</li>\n<li>它提供标准化接口，简化大模型对工具的调用过程，类似USB标准。</li>\n<li>实战中，通过配置server和client，MCP可自动发现并调用工具，无需手动配置参数。</li>\n</ul><p><strong>A to A协议的意义</strong></p><ul>\n<li>A to A协议关注智能体之间的交互，为未来的多智能体协作奠定基础。</li>\n<li>在实际应用中，不同智能体各司其职，通过协议实现高效沟通。</li>\n<li>示例展示了一个本地智能体如何通过A to A协议调用其他智能体完成复杂任务。</li>\n</ul><p><strong>计算1.0与2.0的融合</strong></p><ul>\n<li>计算1.0代表结构化、精确的计算，而计算2.0则基于概率性和模糊推理。</li>\n<li>大模型擅长处理自然语言任务，但数学计算等仍需依赖传统工具。</li>\n<li>结合两者优势，可以开发出更高效的产品和服务。</li>\n</ul><!-- [[[read_end]]] --><p><strong>Q&amp;A环节</strong></p><ul>\n<li>回答了关于数据分析、大模型调用工具的意义以及零基础学习建议等问题。</li>\n<li>强调了提示词工程的重要性，并指出每项任务都需要具体工程设计。</li>\n<li>解释了MCP与OpenAI规范的关系，明确MCP是对现有标准的补充而非替代。</li>\n</ul><p>课件获取链接：<a href=\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1vB3yTfDI3sKTiy_DrnS7Eg\">https://pan.baidu.com/s/1vB3yTfDI3sKTiy_DrnS7Eg</a> 提取码: q42m</p>","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":402075,"user_name":"emerson.cai","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":3634136,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"343A071E07386B","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/37/73/d8/9002c29e.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1755416528,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":146186,"content":"对，总结的很好。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1809833,"ctime":1755508119,"ip_address":"新加坡","comment_id":402075,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101053801,"comment_content":"如果使用Function Call来开发agent，那么开发人员如果想调用多个服务的时候，就需要每个服务都写定制化的代码进行适配处理，而且不同的开发人员单独开发时，这部分需要重复开发。如果使用MCP，相当与把定制化适配这部分工作量让服务提供商来完成，agent只负责调用就行了，也方便不同的开发者共享。本质上就是把定制化开发部分下沉到服务商完成。","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1809833,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1b/9d/a9/4602808f.jpg","nickname":"黄佳","note":"","ucode":"8EC41D2EAB0E3C","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":669884,"discussion_content":"对，总结的很好。","content_length":8,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1755508119,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"新加坡","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":401627,"user_name":"我在学编程","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2339039,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"5BD4619C67D66D","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/vDQCL1bnecibWJbvA7iaZiaem9ibI0HraibG4CM4SlfUrnJIjvXwquQuQ5NlARTCib8iaV3bQ4qnBXQrj6kFWEkfU3IMg/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1753015500,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":146067,"content":"从协议的本质来理解。Function Calling并不是一个协议，而是大模型内部的一种机制，用于通过生成结构化的消息来调用功能。\n\nMCP和A2A则是定义了独立的传输、发现和调用协议，使Agent交互和会话上下文解耦。\n\n业务的具体实现要通过Function Calling、Tool Calls来进行。协议只是让大家更轻松，有规范的把能力发布出去。\n","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1809833,"ctime":1753151360,"ip_address":"新加坡","comment_id":401627,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101053801,"comment_content":"这一套东西和大模型的Function Call的区别在哪里呢","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1809833,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1b/9d/a9/4602808f.jpg","nickname":"黄佳","note":"","ucode":"8EC41D2EAB0E3C","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":668807,"discussion_content":"从协议的本质来理解。Function Calling并不是一个协议，而是大模型内部的一种机制，用于通过生成结构化的消息来调用功能。\n\nMCP和A2A则是定义了独立的传输、发现和调用协议，使Agent交互和会话上下文解耦。\n\n业务的具体实现要通过Function Calling、Tool Calls来进行。协议只是让大家更轻松，有规范的把能力发布出去。\n","content_length":177,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1753151360,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"新加坡","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":401416,"user_name":"@҈҉҈҉҈҉҈҉҈҉҈҉AI","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":4294621,"ip_address":"新加坡","ucode":"56845805181807","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/41/87/dd/42d9bdcd.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1752047965,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":146020,"content":"兄弟觉得呢？","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1809833,"ctime":1752757624,"ip_address":"新加坡","comment_id":401416,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":2,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101053801,"comment_content":"听了1.0和2.0后，开始好奇3.0会是什么？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1809833,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1b/9d/a9/4602808f.jpg","nickname":"黄佳","note":"","ucode":"8EC41D2EAB0E3C","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":668636,"discussion_content":"兄弟觉得呢？","content_length":6,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1752757624,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"新加坡","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":4294621,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/41/87/dd/42d9bdcd.jpg","nickname":"@҈҉҈҉҈҉҈҉҈҉҈҉AI","note":"","ucode":"56845805181807","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":668642,"discussion_content":"脑机互动","content_length":4,"likes_number":1,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1752760065,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"新加坡","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":400951,"user_name":"听水的湖","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1501385,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"B1759F90165D81","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/16/e8/c9/59bcd490.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1750051226,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":145647,"content":"计算1.0和计算2.0，是我从李建忠老师的公众号那里看到的概念。深受启发，理解了这两种计算的本质差异，就理解了为什么LLM应用开发开启了一个新的程序设计纪元。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1809833,"ctime":1750161439,"ip_address":"新加坡","comment_id":400951,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":2,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101053801,"comment_content":"🧐直播学习感受：\n\nMCP像是在做“车同轨”的工作，工具调用更方便，化简和规范单智能体调用工具，单智能体和外部数据交互的工作量。\n\nA2A像是带着野心去做“书同文”的统一，无论这些智能体是如何设计的，都能通过A2A的协议更顺畅的沟通（比如交互数据），让多个智能体在合作协同处理更复杂任务时，能更好地配合。\n\n我会想到通用大模型能力也很强（这也是为什么当时它让我们惊讶，火出技术圈让全民都知道），为什么还要划分这么多的智能体呢？\n\n也许是因为多个智能体可以分离关注点，不同领域&#47;专长的智能体各自发展自己的特色，无需十项全能（可以但成本高），而是多个智能体分工协作，发挥1+1大于2的效果。\n\n😎\n另外1.0的精确计算跟2.0概率计算通过MCP打通了，这个也很有启发。再次理解了一下01里面说的，MCP并不是LLM开发范式的颠覆，而是一种增强。\n\n而此时此刻通过专栏的契机，如果能帮助大伙儿在“正在进行时”状态来一起见证、观测、讨论这样的增强和发展，甚至如果有能力的话去参与其中，感觉是个特别有趣的事情。一起加油吧～","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1809833,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1b/9d/a9/4602808f.jpg","nickname":"黄佳","note":"","ucode":"8EC41D2EAB0E3C","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":664364,"discussion_content":"计算1.0和计算2.0，是我从李建忠老师的公众号那里看到的概念。深受启发，理解了这两种计算的本质差异，就理解了为什么LLM应用开发开启了一个新的程序设计纪元。","content_length":79,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1750161440,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"新加坡","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":3971198,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/3c/98/7e/e0311392.jpg","nickname":"雾凇","note":"","ucode":"326E69185302CD","race_medal":5,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":668120,"discussion_content":"这就跟有了大而全的app，为什么还会有各种垂直app一样，想做得通用就会牺牲垂直能力","content_length":42,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1751549173,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"上海","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":401059,"user_name":"言十年","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1110039,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"67B8B49C3A3B17","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/f0/17/796a3d20.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1750552027,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101053801,"comment_content":"a2a实例代码中的协议好像不是最新的。实例中tasks&#47;send 目前好像最新协议是message&#47;send","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1809833,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1b/9d/a9/4602808f.jpg","nickname":"黄佳","note":"","ucode":"8EC41D2EAB0E3C","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":665171,"discussion_content":"是吗，我回去好好分析研究一下。谢谢大佬。","content_length":20,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1750652635,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"新加坡","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}